        <mxCell id="c58" value="&lt;i&gt;Selected: B40, the check, which reads zero in both columns. Outlined: the cost effect by product type, +$43,345.66, where Tutorial 6.3 reads zero because every item has one standard cost. The two columns share the margins, the change and the volume effect; price lists and promotions together make the Furniture-level price (+$1,073.25 and −$120,687.02).&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="370" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
